Description: pan/bi, panvk: fix MIRRORED_REPEAT texel offsets with implicit LOD
 Compute the implicit LOD on the original coordinates. For isotropic
 sampling from a single level, move the offset into the coordinate and
 sample with that LOD; otherwise keep the hardware implicit sample.
Author: pocket-debs
Origin: https://github.com/masterxq/mesa-lisbon (branch lisbon/26.3)
Forwarded: no
License: MIT (as the patched files)
Last-Update: 2026-11-25
